				<wikidot:authorName>Kykywox</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2784501</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm sure a lot of work went into this and maybe I'm alone in this but I felt this was quite painful to read, hard to follow and just generally confusing.<br /> I get that we're diving into the mind of a weird character, but I'd still like to have a vague understanding of what's going on.<br /> Sorry, can't upvote this one.</p> <p>EDIT: Okay so after reading the other comments (and looking up what a purple prose is), I get the idea of the whole thing and why it's supposed to be the way it is but the fact remains that I find unpleasant to read. Therefore my vote stands.</p> 
				 	]]>
